NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATA

The grant above covers this repository's own SOURCE CODE, including every
package published from `packages/`. It does not cover third-party data files
vendored under `website/public/data/`, which carry their own terms:

  website/public/data/submarine-cables/
      TeleGeography Submarine Cable Map, licensed CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 —
      ATTRIBUTION, SHARE-ALIKE and NON-COMMERCIAL. Not MIT. See that
      directory's own LICENSE and README.md. Commercial use of that data
      requires a licence from TeleGeography; deleting the directory (and the
      `ds-cables` row in
      `website/src/components/MapsWorkbench/mapsDatasets.ts`) removes it
      completely, and no published package depends on either.

  website/public/data/datacenters/, website/public/data/dams/
      Derived from OpenStreetMap, licensed ODbL 1.0 — attribution and
      share-alike on the data. "© OpenStreetMap contributors",
      https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

  website/public/data/natural-earth/, and the country/place/vector tile
  pyramids beside them
      Natural Earth — public domain.

  website/public/data/geo-tiles/
      NOAA NCEI ETOPO1 — public domain (a US federal work).

No file under `packages/` carries any of these terms: the datasets above are
consumed only by the documentation site, through `@glyphcss/maps`' ordinary
public API, and the packages contain none of the data.
